DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270325
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270326
SUMMARY:Feast of the Annunciation\, Messaria
LOCATION:Messaria\, Schoinoussa\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hamlet of Messaria keeps 25 March with a liturgy and kerasmata for the few dozen islanders who are around in spring\, doubling as the national holiday. Only for those already on the island out of season.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/schoinoussa/#messaria-feast-of-the-annunciation-messaria
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/schoinoussa/#messaria-feast-of-the-annunciation-messaria
END:VEVENT
