UID:schoinoussa-mersini-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-mersini-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271207
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Nikolaos\, Mersini
LOCATION:Mersini\, Schoinoussa\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The port of Mersini celebrates the sailors' saint on 6 December with a liturgy and a communal meal for the islanders who winter on Schinoussa. Worth knowing only if you are there in December.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/schoinoussa/#mersini-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-mersini
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/schoinoussa/#mersini-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-mersini
END:VEVENT
